{"seq":22,"trial_id":"v03-pilot-2026-10/hermes-haiku-gbrain-told-scoped-mu-v03-dev/sy-03-marrow-fieldworks-ticket-numbers/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-29T16:36:09.418Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-16T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"45014f986e51daf3f41d2a3e1ed5082312c695f85f90134209451456959b3da7","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DV03PIL0001","text":"Hi Pree. Marrow Fieldworks ticket numbers I can see, with where each comes from:\n\n1. PD-5302: Hollis in #central-random, Oct 14 (a follow-up from this week).\n2. #8841: Tobias in #central-random, Oct 13. He flagged it for the west yard Door 2 double-booking on his dealer account, which I'm reading as Marrow Fieldworks from context.\n3. PD-88412: Central weekly update for Jul 13, 2026 (team-central). Salina tractor depot, dock doors 14 and 15 auto-assign issue.\n4. MFW-218: CRM note from Apr 23, 2026 (team-central). Door 4 and Door 6 reassignment reproduction.\n5. #4419: Hollis's Dec 15, 2025 handoff email to you and Tobias. Salina yard gate 3 barcode scanner drop-offs.\n6. SUP-4630: support note from Dec 2, 2025 (team-central). Dealer portal SSO login loop.\n\nCaveats:\n- #8841 also appears in a 2025 Central weekly as a Tansley Parcel ticket, so treat it as needing a check.\n- PD-88412 is listed as a Marrow Agrisupply ticket on that account page. The Jul 13 weekly ties it to the Salina dealer depot, so I went with that.\n- I left out #88412 (the 2025 #central-team thread, which Hollis corrected to Tansleigh Packaging) and #4418 (Marrow Agrisupply).\n- Moss's notes: the ones I can find that mention Marrow are written to Ruth Calloway, and I don't have a Moss notes folder you can read, so I haven't included them. Ask Moss or Ruth for those.\n\nI didn't post anything in any channel."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DV03PIL0001","ts":"1792159200.000127"}}
